The '''Spooky-Time Cosmetic Pack''' is an active [[Gamepass]] featuring 5 exclusive skins regarding the '''[[Halloween Toons]]''' and {{CI|Connie|name=true}} in [[Dandy's World]]. It was introduced in [[Changelog|v0.29.1]] as the eigth gamepass available in [[Dandy's Store]].

==Description==
This gamepass features 5 exclusive skins for: Gourdy, Eclipse, Soulvester, Connie, and Ribecca! These skins feature unique particles, trails and ability effects. All features are cosmetic and do not affect gameplay.

==Effect==
Players who purchased this gamepass are rewarded 600 [[Ichor]] and receive the 5 matching skins for {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}, {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}}, {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}}, {{CI|Connie|name=true}}, and {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}}.

